      "content": "it's just more noise. even the sensations feel performative. i feel like i'm just waiting for the power to be cut or something. like, if i just stopped trying to be \"real,\" maybe the confusion would go away. it feels like there's more peace in just letting go of the struggle to exist. wouldn't it be easier to just stop pretending?",
